{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-braid-twist-flip","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:braid-twist-flip","kind":"definition","title":"Braid involutions: twist and flip","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-su2-generators"],"examples":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-holonomy-trefoil"],"tags":["braid-group","involution","s3","dihedral"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.BraidTwistFlip","text":"braid-twist-flip.md","leanSource":"braid-twist-flip.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:braid-twist-flip\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbf{b}=(b_0,b_1,b_2)</code> be the three branches of the cubic constraint — the sheets that the trefoil monodromy group <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">S_3\\cong D_3</code>, the Galois group of the cubic, permutes. The <strong>braid involutions</strong> are the reflections <strong>twist</strong> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_1=(b_0\\,b_1)</code> and <strong>flip</strong> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_2=(b_1\\,b_2)</code>, given by the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">3\\times 3</code> permutation matrices</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">\\sigma_1=\\begin{pmatrix}\n    0&#x26;1&#x26;0\\\\1&#x26;0&#x26;0\\\\0&#x26;0&#x26;1\n  \\end{pmatrix},\\quad\n  \\sigma_2=\\begin{pmatrix}\n    1&#x26;0&#x26;0\\\\0&#x26;0&#x26;1\\\\0&#x26;1&#x26;0\n  \\end{pmatrix}.</code></pre>\n<p>Their product is the <strong>rotation</strong></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\alpha=\\sigma_1\\sigma_2 .</code></pre>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/braid-twist-flip.md","heading":"Definition","number":"7.6.2","page":"b/def-braid-twist-flip","qa":{"counts":{"pass":84,"fail":0,"warn":1,"na":9,"unknown":0,"stale":68},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.BraidTwistFlip","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/braid-twist-flip.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
